      <p>To create a cluster with multi-architecture compute machines on {"{"}{"{"} ibm_power_name {"}"}{"}"} (<code>ppc64le</code>), you must have an existing single-architecture (<code>x86_64</code>) cluster. You can then add <code>ppc64le</code> compute machines to your OpenShift Container Platform cluster.</p>
